atest update and play the free demo now!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-05T06:32:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814448505","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:02:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4853480-1842212951309670","game_id":"steam-4853480","kind":"update","title":"Weekly Update – Autosaves, Objective Improvements & Money FX","summary":"","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-31T09:29:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951309670","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:02:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4853480-1841579228673692","game_id":"steam-4853480","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update – A Better Beginning","summary":"Slums: Hauler 2 weekly Demo Update is here!This update focuses heavily on improving the beginning experience of the game and making the demo clearer, more engaging, and more polished.The Gun Smuggling GigThe demo now starts with a completely new introductory scenario. You'll meet a local npc offering you a suspiciously well-paid hauling job, get behind the wheel, and quickly discover that you're transporting more than ordinary construction hardware (like he mentioned).The opening now leads natur","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-23T16:31:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228673692","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:02:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4853480-1840944183781555","game_id":"steam-4853480","kind":"announcement","title":"New Enemy Encounter – Things Just Got Dangerous","summary":"Deliveries just got a little more dangerous in SlumsCity.This update introduces an early game encounter: thought you're in for a normal delivery simulation? think again and Lock 'N Load.What's NewNew Enemy EncounterImproved Off-Screen IndicatorsThe old generic arrow indicators have been replaced.Off-screen objectives now display their actual target icons, making it much easier to understand where you're heading.New Environmental EffectsNew particle effects have been added around the city.All of ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-15T07:26:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183781555","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:02:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4853480-1840310314342775","game_id":"steam-4853480","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update #2 - Combat, Audio & Tutorial Improvements","summary":"Hello everyone!First of all, thank you to everyone who has downloaded and played the Slums: Hauler 2 Demo. Every piece of feedback has been incredibly valuable, and this update focuses on making the first experience smoother and more enjoyable.⚔️ Combat FixesSome enemies and pedestrians were not dealing damage correctly.This has now been fixed, so combat behaves as intended.🔊 Ambient Vehicle AudioAmbient traffic could sometimes be heard from unrealistically long distances, making the city much n","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-06T18:03:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314342775","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:02:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4853480-1839676055898126","game_id":"steam-4853480","kind":"announcement","title":"Gameplay Showcase #3 – Bigger Deliveries with Your First Backpack","summary":"Hey everyone!Here's another short gameplay showcase from Slums: Hauler 2.In this video I reach one of the second progression milestones in the demo: buying your first backpack.At first, you're limited to small delivery jobs of groceries because you can't carry many items. Once you purchase a larger backpack, you unlock contracts that require carrying more goods—and naturally, they pay much better.To demonstrate the difference, I take on a liquor delivery towards the end of the video, loading up ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-04T18:11:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055898126","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:02:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4853480-1839676055890699","game_id":"steam-4853480","kind":"announcement","title":"New gameplay video: Reached the $250 Milestone","summary":"Hey everyone!I've just uploaded another gameplay video from Slums: Hauler 2.This time I reached my second progression milestone—earning $250 through deliveries around the city.With that money, I finally bought my first weapon: the Baseball Bat. I take it for a spin to see how melee combat feels and start preparing for the tougher challenges ahead.Every milestone unlocks something new, and this is the first step toward expanding beyond simple delivery jobs.As always, feedback is hugely appreciate","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-01T13:14:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055890699","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:02:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4853480-1839676055886003","game_id":"steam-4853480","kind":"announcement","title":"Watch the First Minutes of Slums: Hauler 2 Gameplay","summary":"Hello everyone!Instead of putting together a cinematic trailer, I wanted to show the game exactly as it is.This video follows the opening of Slums: Hauler 2, from the very beginning of the game to completing the first delivery. No cuts, no scripted showcase—just the real first-time player experience.If you're curious about how the game feels to play, this is the best place to start.If you've already tried the demo, I'd love to hear whether your experience matched what you see in the video.Thanks","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-30T17:28:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055886003","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:02:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4853480-1839676055883193","game_id":"steam-4853480","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update – Clearer Objectives, Better UI & Bug Fixes","summary":"Highlights:• Clear objective markers that are harder to miss. • Fixed a bug where the items you pic up dont appear in your inventory • Ambient vehicles will now be able to pass each other from the side, and not simply collide.• House objective updated to $5,000 • Various UI improvements and bug fixes• Ambient vehicles that accidently running over ambient pedestrians wont reward you money.• General polish and stability improvements","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-29T17:41:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055883193","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:02:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4853480-1839041357031924","game_id":"steam-4853480","kind":"announcement","title":"Slums: Hauler 2 Demo Available Now!","summary":"The Slums Are Waiting.The **Slums: Hauler 2 Demo** is now available on Steam!Start with nothing and work your way up by taking hauling and delivery jobs, earning money, buying vehicles, surviving, and building your life in a gritty open-world city.What You'll Find in the Demo\"- Hauling a